   T('Use the two vector integrals h = r \u00d7 v and \u03bce = v \u00d7 h \u2212 \u03bc r/r, then the energy.', 'Utiliser les deux intégrales vectorielles h = r \u00d7 v et \u03bce = v \u00d7 h \u2212 \u03bc r/r, puis l\u2019énergie.', 'Usar las dos integrales vectoriales h = r \u00d7 v y \u03bce = v \u00d7 h \u2212 \u03bc r/r, y luego la energía.', 'نستخدم التكاملين المتجهين h = r \u00d7 v و \u03bce = v \u00d7 h \u2212 \u03bc r/r، ثم الطاقة.', 'Usare i due integrali vettoriali h = r \u00d7 v e \u03bce = v \u00d7 h \u2212 \u03bc r/r, poi l\u2019energia.'),
   ['|h| = |r \u00d7 v| = {coe_h:1} km\u00b2/s', '|e| = {coe_e:6}', '\u03b5 = v\u00b2/2 \u2212 \u03bc/r = {coe_energy:3} km\u00b2/s\u00b2', 'a = \u2212\u03bc/(2\u03b5) = {coe_a:2} km'],
